## 3. Persistence ⚠️ implement after 2

**JPA entity:**

```
@Entity
@Table(name = "table_name")
public class [Entity]JpaEntity {
  @Id
  private [IdType] id;

  @Column(nullable = false, unique = true)
  private [ColumnType] field;
}
```

**Relations:**
- [Aggregate]JpaEntity ← [Related]JpaEntity: [1:1 | 1:N | N:N]
- Cascade: `[PERSIST | REMOVE | ...]`
- OrphanRemoval: `[true | false]`

**Migrations:**

```sql
-- target: src/main/resources/db/migration/V<N>__create_table_name.sql
CREATE TABLE table_name (
  id [TYPE] PRIMARY KEY,
  field [TYPE] NOT NULL UNIQUE,
  created_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE INDEX idx_field ON table_name(field);
```

**Required indexes:**
- Search index on field X (query hot path)
- Composite index (field1, field2) if pagination orders by both

**Transactions:**

