## Implementation order (checklist)

[ ] 1. Materialize migration V<N>__create_table_name.sql from § 3
[ ] 2. Create JpaEntity + @Table + @Column
[ ] 3. Create Repository interface (Spring Data)
[ ] 4. Create domain aggregate + constructor + invariants
[ ] 5. Create VOs + validations in the constructor
[ ] 6. Create ports (input UseCase, output Repository)
[ ] 7. Create domain events
[ ] 8. Implement repository adapter (JpaRepository)
[ ] 9. Create controller + `@PostMapping` + `@GetMapping` + `@PatchMapping`
[ ] 10. Create DTOs + manual mapper (don't use automatic `@Mapping`)
[ ] 11. Create `ApiExceptionHandler` (handle the 5 error shapes) + ProblemDetail
[ ] 12. Update `application.yml` (JPA, OpenAPI, pagination, tracing, validation)
[ ] 13. Register the Idempotency-Key interceptor if needed
[ ] 14. Create test fixtures (builders, test data)
[ ] 15. Create `AggregateTest` — unit (isolated domain)
[ ] 16. Create `RepositoryIT` — integration (DB + transactions)
[ ] 17. Create `ControllerTest` — contract (REST slice + Idempotency-Key)
[ ] 18. Verify coverage ≥ 80/70 (JaCoCo report)
[ ] 19. Run `./mvnw verify` — green build + passing CI

